  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "adm_body",
   "x": 1600,
   "y": 210,
   "width": 290,
   "height": 400,
   "text": "Corral staff · white-glove\nMirrors all organizer surfaces (B1–B8)\nfor ANY event, plus oversight:\n\n• A-01 Multi-event overview\n• A-02 Organizer / customer mgmt\n• A-03 Act-on-behalf (impersonation)\n• A-04 Calendar seeding\n• A-05 Global delivery monitor\n• A-06 Audit log\n• A-07 Support / privacy requests\n• A-08 Operations / job health\n\nSensitive actions require an\naudit reason (refunds, PII export,\npublish, impersonation).",
   "originalText": "Corral staff · white-glove\nMirrors all organizer surfaces (B1–B8)\nfor ANY event, plus oversight:\n\n• A-01 Multi-event overview\n• A-02 Organizer / customer mgmt\n• A-03 Act-on-behalf (impersonation)\n• A-04 Calendar seeding\n• A-05 Global delivery monitor\n• A-06 Audit log\n• A-07 Support / privacy requests\n• A-08 Operations / job health\n\nSensitive actions require an\naudit reason (refunds, PII export,\npublish, impersonation).",
